    "facts": "In January, 2021, Shweta took the informant to the present Applicant who was in the construction business.\nHe had eight Pradeep Motichand Gupta vs State Of Maharashtra on 14 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/72014847/\n1 flats available.\nA transaction was entered into for purchasing those flats for Rs.78 Lakhs.\nThe Applicant sold one of those eight flats and paid Rs.12 Lakhs to the informant and thus earned his trust.\n",
